    {
      "subId": "2302804",
      "subQuestName": "Go and spray the potions",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230280401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230280401": {
            "id": "230280401",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Awan",
            "text": "Yasmin? What are you doing here? Ugh... Are you here to sprinkle your potion again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280402"
            ]
          },
          "230280402": {
            "id": "230280402",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Awan",
            "text": "Those roots look perfectly fine. No more potions are needed here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280403"
            ]
          },
          "230280403": {
            "id": "230280403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Even so, we should take good care of them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280404"
            ]
          },
          "230280404": {
            "id": "230280404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Crossing the bridge only when we get to it is like getting a Fish Roll ready, only to realize that the fish is undercooked.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280405"
            ]
          },
          "230280405": {
            "id": "230280405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "At that point, your options are either to start all over again or to open up the already rolled pastry, both of which are a pain in the neck.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280406"
            ]
          },
          "230280406": {
            "id": "230280406",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Awan",
            "text": "Okay, okay, I can't beat you in an argument... But I have talked to you about the smell of that potion, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280407"
            ]
          },
          "230280407": {
            "id": "230280407",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Awan",
            "text": "I live nearby, and I don't want to sleep with that funky smell in my nostrils, alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280408"
            ]
          },
          "230280408": {
            "id": "230280408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Don't worry, I already had Ladep adjust the formula. The odor shouldn't be too offensive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280409"
            ]
          },
          "230280409": {
            "id": "230280409",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Awan",
            "text": "Fine then, I'm leaving. Don't come sprinkling that potion of yours near my yard. I can't take it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280410"
            ]
          },
          "230280410": {
            "id": "230280410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Alright, I get it. Traveler, could you pass me the potions in that case?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280411"
            ]
          },
          "230280411": {
            "id": "230280411",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You administer the potions with Yasmin...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280412"
            ]
          },
          "230280412": {
            "id": "230280412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The potions really do smell terrible...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280413"
            ]
          },
          "230280413": {
            "id": "230280413",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But it seems that you're not bothered by it at all, Yasmin...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280414"
            ]
          },
          "230280414": {
            "id": "230280414",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "If you mean the smell... My nose has whiffed many things far worse than that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280415"
            ]
          },
          "230280415": {
            "id": "230280415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Alright, that should be all we need. I have also gathered some data. I'm sure Pharez will be thrilled...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280416"
            ]
          },
          "230280416": {
            "id": "230280416",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Here is your payment, Traveler. Thank you for your help so far.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230280417"
            ]
          },
          "230280417": {
            "id": "230280417",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "I wonder how Ladep and Pharez are doing with their work..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
